{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Parents/guardian legal right to prevent use of their deceased child\u2019s image",
        "additional_details": "I am aware of many troubling examples of deceased children\u2019s images after their death in ways which the families does not agree with, and which in some cases have caused families\u2019 distress. Grief should never be turned into content, profit or something that fuels retaliation.",
        "background": "I want parents or guardians to have the legal right to stop people using a dead child's name or picture to make money, mock them, provoke others or glorify violence and to be able to get that content removed when the family has not agreed to it.",
